; An open enum named by the file's own namespace reaches as one named bare:
; with contract given as the namespace qualified, Launch reaches Model and so
; does Pair, which holds it; both are read only through Opening, and Pair is
; no type Model carries. Effort reaches nothing and is carried.
Signal
[]
[ Launch.:qualified:contract:Model
  Hold.Pair ]
[ Launched
  Refused.String ]
[ Pair.{ :qualified:contract:Model Effort }
  Effort.[ Low High ] ]
[ Model ]
